      "value": "@{62e03f4e44af5544b2228fa5|full_name} I don't see the relevance.  This is about VRChat getting 5-10 bucks so they can pay for the age verification process... and anyone with a an active or inactive VRChat+ on their account being able to use the age verification registration regardless of if they have an active + subscription or not.\n\nDoesn't matter who is paying for it.  We just want to be able to age verify people legitimately and protect our communities.",
