      "value": "@{5f30bc51654cd44914561e2d|full_name} Age verification is about trusting the platform you want to be on, If someone is paying for your process, thats not You trusting the platform with your payment, Thats someone else, Seems rather evasive to me, The idea of AV Being being VRC+ Active subscriptions are a more effective manor of knowing that user will stay on the platform for awhile longer verses someone gifting it to an inactive user, Everything they do needs to make ecomic sence as VRChat needs money to operate, Letting that go could put the company in a bad spot.",
