  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Suggestion:  You should be able to make a one time purchase of VRChat+ and then register for age verification ANY TIME.\n\nCurrently:  Age Verification for VRChat requires you to be subscribed to VRChat+ to register.  If you don't have VRChat+ the next month and you forgot to register or never realized it was a feature, you won't be able to register till you resubscribe.\n\nThe devs need money to do the age verification stuff.  It can't exactly be made free easily.\n\nThis is such an important feature for moderation and its a giant hurdle to transition to as a big community because people don't have the money or didn't know registration was a thing when they did.",
